{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-panel-ui-shell-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"panel","area":"panel/ui-shell","refs":["F-panel-505","FN-L14-panel-logic-2-02"],"severity":"S3","title":"The number on the browser tab and the number on the bell count different things","what":"The browser tab shows a waiting number made only from plan requests, check-in numbers, new shop orders, member questions and member messages. The bell's number comes from the server's alert list, which also holds enquiries to call, online joins, complaints and unread news. The owner sees, say, (2) on the tab and 5 on the bell for the same moment, and an enquiry or a paid joiner never shows on the tab at all.","expected":"One waiting number, read from the same list, on the tab, the bell and Today.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/NeedsYou.tsx:462-468","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/needsYou.ts:51-59","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/WhatsNew.tsx:416-417","supabase/migrations/0098_alerts_done_and_read.sql:46-47"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"tab-count-not-from-bell-list","who":"owners and front desk","how_often":"whenever an enquiry, join, complaint or news alert waits","fix_line":"Make the tab number the bell's own to-do count from the server","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-panel-ui-shell-b-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"panel","area":"panel/ui-shell","refs":["F-panel-506","F-panel-1109","FN-B-alerts-panel-logic-1-b-06"],"severity":"S4","title":"Admin app updates and new-feature dots read on one device show as new on every other device","what":"Which What's new updates were read, and which new-feature dots were opened, is kept only in the browser that did it, not per person and not on the server. The owner who read an update on the phone sees it counted again in the bell on the desk computer, and on a shared desk computer one person opening it clears it for everyone.","expected":"Read updates and opened dots kept for each person on the server, so the bell number agrees on every device.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/whatsNew.ts:616-659","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/newDots.ts:16","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/newDots.ts:164-181","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/WhatsNew.tsx:69-78","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/WhatsNew.tsx:416-417"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"app-news-seen-per-browser","who":"owners and staff using more than one device","how_often":"each new update","fix_line":"Keep read updates and seen dots per person on the server, as the gym alerts already are","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
